    family-names: "Naseri"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9493-1807"
version: "0.2.0.dev0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/M0574F4/noema-lab"
url: "https://M0574F4.github.io/noema-lab/"
abstract: >-
  Noema represents learned-communication comparisons as executable experiment contracts linking
  validated protocols, concrete execution plans, declared communication-resource accounting,
  optional returned-model interfaces, and retained result and plot evidence. Its verification is
  local and profile-scoped.
keywords:
  - learned communications
  - experiment contracts
  - benchmark evaluation
  - evidence provenance
  - semantic communications
  - learned compression
